# Refresh on the chart path: a number, `auto` three ways (the chart's update every with `unaligned`, also over a
# window of another length, else the request's own window), a negative number, zero, a text, another case; over a
# relative and an absolute window: the cache word, the date left unset, the expiry.
chart b.r b.r_name b.ctx fam things 2
entries b.r 1 100
lookup b.r 200 5 0
clock 100
badge chart=b.r&refresh=5
badge chart=b.r&refresh=auto
badge chart=b.r&refresh=auto&options=unaligned
badge chart=b.r&refresh=auto&options=unaligned&after=-600&before=-60
badge chart=b.r&refresh=auto&after=-600&before=-60
badge chart=b.r&refresh=auto&after=100&before=700
badge chart=b.r&refresh=auto&after=700&before=100
badge chart=b.r&refresh=-7
badge chart=b.r&refresh=0
badge chart=b.r&refresh=text
badge chart=b.r&refresh=AUTO
badge chart=b.r&refresh=5&refresh=9
lookup b.r 200 5 0 absolute
badge chart=b.r&refresh=5
badge chart=b.r&refresh=0
badge chart=b.r
